      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        82.88348388671875,
        513.4212036132812,
        96.62598419189453
      ],
      "text": "children with known or suspected immunocompromising conditions  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        96.6834716796875,
        324.33843994140625,
        110.31097412109375
      ],
      "text": "(especially those living with HIV), and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        116.752685546875,
        510.1783447265625,
        130.4951934814453
      ],
      "text": "child contacts of index cases with MDR-TB or XDR-TB (proven or suspected) -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.89440155029297,
        141.50067138671875,
        370.8329162597656,
        154.8521728515625
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.89440155029297,
        166.23715209960938,
        510.2360534667969,
        179.65765380859375
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations for investigating contacts of persons with infectious tu- Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.89440155029297,
        180.03713989257812,
        513.4559326171875,
        193.4576416015625
      ],
      "text": "berculosis in low- and middle-income countries.  Geneva, World Health Organization",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.89440155029297,
        193.9061279296875,
        245.43692016601562,
        207.25762939453125
      ],
      "text": "2012 (WHO/HTM/TB/2012.9)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        215.9056396484375,
        513.444580078125,
        229.25714111328125
      ],
      "text": "Contact screening is a mechanism of active or intensified case-finding and is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        231.83316040039062,
        513.467529296875,
        245.253662109375
      ],
      "text": "(12-14) recommended by various agencies, including WHO  . Early identification of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        247.898681640625,
        513.4445190429688,
        261.25018310546875
      ],
      "text": "disease among contacts can reduce both disease severity - thereby improving outcomes",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        263.89520263671875,
        513.3984375,
        277.2467041015625
      ],
      "text": "- and subsequent rates of transmission. If the index case is a child, it is recommended",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        279.8917236328125,
        429.4254150390625,
        293.24322509765625
      ],
      "text": "that contact screening include efforts to identify the likely source case.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        304.39825439453125,
        513.4788818359375,
        317.749755859375
      ],
      "text": "Young children living in close contact with a source case of smear-positive pulmonary",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        320.3947448730469,
        513.3524780273438,
        333.7462463378906
      ],
      "text": "TB are at particular risk of TB infection and disease. The risk of infection is greatest if the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        336.3912353515625,
        513.5018920898438,
        349.74273681640625
      ],
      "text": "contact is close and prolonged (such as contact of an infant or toddler with the mother",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        352.3877258300781,
        513.4100341796875,
        365.7392272949219
      ],
      "text": "or other caregiver in the household). The risk of developing disease after infection is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        368.3152160644531,
        513.444580078125,
        381.7357177734375
      ],
      "text": "(15) much greater for infants and young children under 5 years of age . If disease does",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        384.3807067871094,
        513.444580078125,
        397.7322082519531
      ],
      "text": "develop, it usually does so within 1 year of infection, but in infants the time-lag can be as",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        400.377197265625,
        513.467529296875,
        413.72869873046875
      ],
      "text": "short as a few weeks. Children of any age who are household contacts of MDR-TB index",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        416.3736877441406,
        513.5020141601562,
        429.7251892089844
      ],
      "text": "cases are at especially high risk of contracting MDR-TB, and so their prompt evaluation,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        432.3011779785156,
        513.5020141601562,
        445.7216796875
      ],
      "text": "(9) and treatment if necessary, is important . See also Chapter 7 on the management of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        448.3666687011719,
        225.2083740234375,
        461.7181701660156
      ],
      "text": "drug-resistant TB in children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        475.4299011230469,
        213.58639526367188,
        489.0574035644531
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 19 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        499.1844177246094,
        510.2265625,
        514.5184326171875
      ],
      "text": "It is recommended that contact investigation should be conducted for house-",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        512.3843994140625,
        510.2373962402344,
        527.7183837890625
      ],
      "text": "hold and close contacts when the index case has any of the following charac-",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        525.58447265625,
        151.94537353515625,
        540.91845703125
      ],
      "text": "teristics:",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        545.8298950195312,
        346.69439697265625,
        559.5723876953125
      ],
      "text": "has sputum smear-positive pulmonary TB, -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        565.2992553710938,
        367.5323791503906,
        579.041748046875
      ],
      "text": "has MDR-TB or XDR-TB (proven or suspected); -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        584.7684936523438,
        265.0214538574219,
        598.510986328125
      ],
      "text": "is a person living with HIV; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        604.23779296875,
        253.29144287109375,
        617.9802856445312
      ],
      "text": "is a child <5 years of age -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.89440155029297,
        628.9857788085938,
        370.8329162597656,
        642.3372802734375
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.89440155029297,
        653.7223510742188,
        510.2360534667969,
        667.142822265625
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations for investigating contacts of persons with infectious tu- Source:",
