        667.5223388671875,
        513.4559326171875,
        680.9428100585938
      ],
      "text": "berculosis in low- and middle-income countries.  Geneva, World Health Organization",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.89440155029297,
        681.3912963867188,
        245.43692016601562,
        694.7427978515625
      ],
      "text": "2012 (WHO/HTM/TB/2012.9)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04640197753906,
        705.9208374023438,
        213.59339904785156,
        719.54833984375
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 20 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        729.66162109375,
        513.295654296875,
        744.99560546875
      ],
      "text": "Contact investigation may be conducted for household and close contacts of",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        742.8616333007812,
        510.21563720703125,
        758.1956176757812
      ],
      "text": "all other index cases with pulmonary TB, in addition to the index cases cov-",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        756.0616455078125,
        249.746337890625,
        771.3956298828125
      ],
      "text": "ered in Recommendation 19",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
